WEBVTT

00:06:29.069 --> 00:06:31.847
he is the shaper of the landscape."

00:06:31.871 --> 00:06:33.022
In other words,

00:06:33.046 --> 00:06:37.498
humans are not playthings
of cosmic forces,

00:06:37.522 --> 00:06:40.661
we are users of cosmic forces.

00:06:41.093 --> 00:06:42.863
I'll say more about that in a moment,

00:06:42.887 --> 00:06:47.434
but first, what sorts
of thing create novelty?

00:06:48.022 --> 00:06:51.172
Well, the beginning
of the universe surely did.

00:06:51.196 --> 00:06:54.268
The big bang, nearly 14 billion years ago,

00:06:54.292 --> 00:06:57.680
created space, time and energy,

00:06:57.704 --> 00:06:59.212
everything physical.

00:06:59.609 --> 00:07:01.712
And then, immediately,